---
// Hero.astro: 铭泰易拉盖外贸独立站首屏
---

<section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-slate-900 py-28 md:py-36">
	<!-- 背景图片 -->
	<div class="absolute inset-0 z-0" aria-hidden="true">
		<img
			src="/hero-bg.png"
			alt=""
			width="1920"
			height="1080"
			fetchpriority="high"
			loading="eager"
			decoding="async"
			class="h-full w-full max-w-none object-cover object-[center_40%] sm:object-center"
		/>
	</div>

	<!-- 暗色渐变遮罩：左侧压暗便于文字阅读，保留右侧产线景深 -->
	<div
		class="absolute inset-0 z-10 bg-gradient-to-r from-slate-950/85 via-slate-900/70 to-slate-900/45"
		aria-hidden="true"
	>
	</div>

	<!-- 内容层 -->
	<div class="relative z-20 mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 text-center sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
		<span
			class="mb-6 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-sky-600/90 px-5 py-1.5 text-sm font-semibold tracking-wide text-white shadow-sm backdrop-blur-sm"
		>
			<svg
				class="h-4 w-4 shrink-0"
				width="16"
				height="16"
				fill="currentColor"
				viewBox="0 0 20 20"
				aria-hidden="true"
			>
				<path
					d="M9.049 2.927c.3-.921 1.603-.921 1.902 0l1.07 3.292a1 1 0 00.95.69h3.462c.969 0 1.371 1.24.588 1.81l-2.8 2.034a1 1 0 00-.364 1.118l1.07 3.292c.3.921-.755 1.683-1.54 1.118l-2.8-2.034a1 1 0 00-1.175 0l-2.8 2.034c-.784.565-1.838-.197-1.539-1.118l1.07-3.292a1 1 0 00-.364-1.118L2.98 8.72c-.783-.57-.38-1.81.588-1.81h3.461a1 1 0 00.951-.69l1.07-3.292z"
				></path>
			</svg>
			Over 13 Years of Manufacturing Excellence • OEM &amp; ODM Solutions
		</span>

		<h1
			class="mb-6 text-4xl font-extrabold leading-tight tracking-tight text-white drop-shadow-md sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl"
		>
			Professional <span class="text-sky-400">Easy Open Ends</span> &amp;
			<br class="hidden sm:inline" />Custom Metal Packaging Manufacturer
		</h1>

		<p
			class="mx-auto mb-10 max-w-3xl text-lg font-light leading-relaxed text-slate-200 drop-shadow md:text-xl"
		>
			Dedicated to <strong class="font-medium text-white">High-Quality</strong> products at a
			<strong class="font-medium text-white">Reasonable Price</strong>. Backed by strict quality
			control and <strong class="font-medium text-white">Reputation First</strong>, serving global
			food, beverage, and packaging brands.
		</p>

		<div class="mb-12 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-6 text-sm text-slate-300 sm:gap-10 md:text-base">
			<div class="flex items-center gap-2">
				<span class="h-2.5 w-2.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-red-500" aria-hidden="true"></span>
				<span class="font-medium text-white">Reasonable Price</span>
			</div>
			<div class="flex items-center gap-2">
				<span class="h-2.5 w-2.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-red-500" aria-hidden="true"></span>
				<span class="font-medium text-white">Reputation First</span>
			</div>
			<div class="flex items-center gap-2">
				<span class="h-2.5 w-2.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-red-500" aria-hidden="true"></span>
				<span class="font-medium text-white">High-Quality</span>
			</div>
		</div>

		<div class="flex flex-col justify-center gap-4 sm:flex-row">
			<a
				href="#products"
				class="transform rounded-xl bg-sky-600 px-8 py-4 text-center text-base font-semibold text-white shadow-lg transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:bg-sky-700"
			>
				Explore Products
			</a>
			<a
				href="#contact"
				class="rounded-xl border border-white/20 bg-white/10 px-8 py-4 text-center text-base font-semibold text-white backdrop-blur-md transition hover:bg-white/20"
			>
				Request OEM/ODM Quote
			</a>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
